        "Content": "•\tTraditional Corporation-Built 2 Bedroom Residence\r\n\r\n•\tRefurbishment & Modernisation Opportunity\r\n\r\n•\tTwo Generous Double Bedrooms\r\n\r\n•\tDriveway Potential (subject to planning permission)\r\n\r\n•\tPrivate Rear Garden With Rear Access \r\n\r\n•\tExtension Potential (subject to planning permission)\r\n\r\n•\tWalking Distance of Dublin City Centre, IFSC & Docklands\r\n\r\n•\tConvenient to Fairview, Drumcondra and Clontarf"
